OL,3,AEd Sheeran admits 'mistakes' as he
OL,4,Aaddresses Macklemore controversy at
OL,5,APhiladelphia show
OL,6,
OL,7,FSinger Ed Sheeran has apologised to
OL,8,Ffans for making "mistakes", as he
OL,9,Fopened a solo show in Philadelphia by
OL,10,Faddressing the controversy that has
OL,11,Fengulfed his tour.
OL,13,FThe star responded to the fallout over
OL,14,Frapper Macklemore being dropped from
OL,15,Fthe tour for making pro-Palestinian
OL,16,Fremarks on stage earlier in September.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
