OL,3,AEd Sheeran admits 'mistakes' as he
OL,4,Aaddresses Macklemore controversy at
OL,5,APhiladelphia show
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I never wanted to be an activist
OL,8,Fmusician, but this has put me in the
OL,9,Fmiddle of an important and passionate
OL,10,Fargument about free speech and the most
OL,11,Fcomplex political issue on the planet,"
OL,12,Fhe said at Saturday's show.
OL,14,FHe described the 7 October 2023
OL,15,FHamas-led attacks as "horrific" and
OL,16,Fcalled the situation in Gaza
OL,17,F"unjustifiable" in his first in-person
OL,18,Fremarks since the controversy began.
